\ngas accounting is initiating a project to ensure consistent treatment of\r\nphysical storage between flash and the gl . to that end , please provide the\r\nbook codes and cost of inventory schedules that you have for each of the\r\nphysical storage facilities . we will also need what you show as the 1 / 31 / 01\r\ninventory balance for each .\r\ndavid ,\r\ni believe that we already have the information for bammel . please provide\r\nthe info for other texas desk storage , if any .\r\ni would like to have this information as soon as possible .\r\nthanks , everyone .',ham
