'Subject: enrononline launch monday 18 th .\r\nwe are pleased to announce that as of monday , sept . 18 , the new version of\r\nenrononline will be launched to all our customers .\r\nwhen our customers log in on this day , they will be given the option to\r\nupgrade to the new version . they can choose to immediately upgrade , or to\r\nupgrade at a later time .\r\nif the customers choose to upgrade , they will be taken through the same steps\r\nas when you upgraded . if the customers choose not to upgrade , they will\r\nreceive a version of enrononline which is the same as the \" old \" version , but\r\nthe colors will be blue , instead of black .\r\ncustomers who choose not to immediately upgrade can can do so at a later time\r\nby pressing the \" upgrade to version 2 \" button in the top left corner of their\r\nscreen .\r\nsome customers may have browser or firewall restrictions which could cause\r\ndifficulties in upgrading to the new version of enrononline . we have\r\nenrononline help desk and it troubleshooters standing by to help anyone in\r\nthis situation . for assistance , please direct calls to :\r\nnorth america 713 853 4357\r\neurope + 44 20 7783 7783\r\naustralia / asia + 61 2 9229 2300\r\nenrononline marketing personnel will be calling customers to help guide them\r\nthrough the new features , but it would be appreciated if you could also point\r\nout some of the new features when you are talking to your customers .\r\nas of monday , all internal users should also use the usual\r\nwww . enrononline . com to get to the new version .\r\nthank you for your assistance in making enrononline a success .\r\ndave',ham
